{"id":"revolucio_n","lemma":"revolución","pos":"noun","rank":1929,"glosses":["revolution (political/social)","revolution (act of revolving)"],"ipa":"/reboluˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"revoluciones"},"order":1964,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-revoluci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La revolución ha traído muchos cambios.","en":"The revolution has brought about many changes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767659","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"used, worn"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"change, shift","l":"cambio"}]},{"text":"La revolución francesa tuvo lugar en 1789.","en":"The French Revolution took place in 1789.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516280","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"French","l":"francés"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"in / on"}]},{"text":"La revolución introdujo una nueva era.","en":"The revolution ushered in a new era.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34479","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to insert","l":"introducir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"news, novelty"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"}]}]}